    "Deliveries given up on" : "Consegne abbandonate",
    "Once the reason is fixed, \"occ social:queue:retry --instance HOST\" puts them back in the queue." : "Una volta risolta la causa, \"occ social:queue:retry --instance HOST\" le rimette in coda.",
